/**
 * A made-up synth with one of every part the panel renderer draws: every
 * control type and knob style, every decor kind, every jack look and a pin
 * matrix. Model D uses a fraction of them; this is what the part tests render
 * so each drawing branch runs in both the hardware and the outline view.
 *
 * Not a real instrument and not a fixture of the prototype: the values are
 * only what each part needs to draw.
 */

